": false, "body": "アルさんこんにちは！\nよろしければ、都市伝説課自陣の四葩と夢くんをお願いしたいです！\nかっこいい雰囲気で構図などはお任せします！　よろしくお願いします！", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@arftarou05/works/7", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/2c69445a/uploads/origins/9be6e86d-0769-4f6c-90b2-4c1dbe6e0981?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=93d731e020bd55dda5137800d55115e4", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/2c69445a/uploads/origins/9be6e86d-0769-4f6c-90b2-4c1dbe6e0981?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=93d731e020bd55dda5137800d55115e4, https://si.imgix.net/2c69445a/uploads/origins/9be6e86d-0769-4f6c-90b2-4c1dbe6e0981?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=54c89d12c071b14b1f6e9ccccea301ca 2x, https://si.imgix.net/2c69445a/uploads/origins/9be6e86d-0769-4f6c-90b2-4c1dbe6e0981?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=2082a0af160bc1d7f25804938c765873 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@arftarou05/works/6", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/039d9c74/uploads/origins/529df4ce-0f12-4601-ac09-d68210817243?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=c8beef8c067fc3d3264d42163f38f66f", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/039d9c74/uploads/origins/529df4ce-0f12-4601-ac09-d68210817243?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=c8beef8c067fc3d3264d42163f38f66f, https://si.imgix.net/039d9c74/uploads/origins/529df4ce-0f12-4601-ac09-d68210817243?bg=%23fff&auto=form